WEBVTT

01:41.080 --> 01:45.920
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

01:55.040 --> 01:56.120
Grandma?

01:56.200 --> 01:57.400
How come you're here?

01:59.600 --> 02:00.840
Who is inside?

02:03.680 --> 02:04.560
Who are you hiding?

02:04.640 --> 02:05.920
Who is it?

02:06.000 --> 02:06.880
Speak up!

02:06.960 --> 02:08.160
Who else could it be?

02:08.240 --> 02:09.520
She's still asleep.

02:09.600 --> 02:11.120
You dishonorable child.

02:11.200 --> 02:12.480
You've ruined her innocence.

02:12.560 --> 02:13.520
I'll beat you to death.

02:13.600 --> 02:15.640
You will apologize
in front of your grandpa.

02:15.720 --> 02:16.920
Wait, Grandma.

02:17.000 --> 02:18.000
Quiet down.

02:18.080 --> 02:19.200
Please.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.880
You can hit me when we're home.

02:20.960 --> 02:22.200
You reprobate!

02:22.280 --> 02:23.440
Wait.

02:23.520 --> 02:24.440
You can hit me.

02:24.520 --> 02:26.000
Don't get upset. It's not worth it.

02:26.080 --> 02:28.200
Also, the neighbors might see us.

02:28.760 --> 02:30.360
Now you know shame.

02:31.120 --> 02:32.000
As your grandma,

02:32.080 --> 02:33.800
I need to discipline you.

02:34.920 --> 02:36.240
Come here.

02:36.320 --> 02:38.120
Mrs. Chen!

02:39.360 --> 02:40.240
Mrs. Chen.

02:40.320 --> 02:41.200
Don't hit him.

02:41.680 --> 02:42.920
It was consensual.

02:43.000 --> 02:44.960
Jie, stop protecting him.

02:45.040 --> 02:46.720
I know what is happening.

02:46.800 --> 02:48.480
I will make sure you're not wronged.

02:48.560 --> 02:50.360
He took advantage of you,

02:50.440 --> 02:52.200
so I will do the same to him.

02:52.280 --> 02:53.480
Mrs. Chen!

02:53.560 --> 02:55.920
It was consensual. He didn't do me wrong.

02:56.000 --> 02:57.520
Hit me if you want.

02:57.600 --> 02:58.560
Jie,

02:59.440 --> 03:00.600
I will call your mom.

03:00.680 --> 03:02.200
I'm willing to accept any punishment

03:02.280 --> 03:03.720
from your family.

03:03.800 --> 03:05.520
There's really no need, Mrs. Chen.

03:05.600 --> 03:06.720
My mom knows.

03:07.720 --> 03:08.880
Your…

03:08.960 --> 03:10.440
Your mom knows about this?

03:12.520 --> 03:13.520
In any case,

03:13.600 --> 03:15.520
my mom knows I can't
stay away from Chen Maidong.

03:16.200 --> 03:17.080
That still won't do!

03:18.120 --> 03:19.720
I am a traditional person.

03:19.800 --> 03:21.120
This doesn't sit right with me.

03:25.600 --> 03:28.000
Or we can call the police.

03:29.600 --> 03:30.480
Mrs. Chen.

03:30.960 --> 03:31.840
Please.

03:33.560 --> 03:34.640
Kneel.

03:36.440 --> 03:37.640
Why should I kneel?

03:38.400 --> 03:40.880
Because this is against my principles.

03:41.520 --> 03:42.640
You have no bottom line,

03:42.720 --> 03:44.720
but she does.

03:44.800 --> 03:46.040
At this point,

03:46.800 --> 03:48.000
you two must get married.

03:49.200 --> 03:50.920
Can you not make this decision for us?

03:51.000 --> 03:52.360
It's our business. We'll handle it.

03:52.440 --> 03:53.560
Speak no further.

03:53.640 --> 03:55.640
Do you want to abandon her now?

03:55.720 --> 03:57.080
Or are you, Jie,

03:57.160 --> 03:58.800
abandoning Maidong now?

03:58.880 --> 04:00.400
Mrs. Chen, I will never do that.

04:01.520 --> 04:03.680
But this is so sudden.

04:05.480 --> 04:06.520
No marriage then.

04:07.120 --> 04:08.040
But get engaged.

04:08.960 --> 04:10.320
Otherwise, I'll beat you to death.

04:12.040 --> 04:13.080
Beat me to death then.

04:13.560 --> 04:15.120
Don't force her to do anything.

04:15.200 --> 04:16.440
You can't coerce an engagement.

04:17.600 --> 04:19.040
You! I…

04:20.160 --> 04:21.000
I…

04:22.000 --> 04:22.920
-I'll beat--
-Mrs. Chen!

04:25.640 --> 04:26.480
Jie,

04:26.560 --> 04:27.720
don't worry.

04:27.800 --> 04:31.720
No matter when, I'll be great to you.

04:33.240 --> 04:34.720
Girls help girls.

04:34.800 --> 04:35.720
Girl…

04:35.800 --> 04:37.720
What? Girl what?

04:37.800 --> 04:39.720
"Girls" means us.

04:39.800 --> 04:40.920
"Girls."

04:41.000 --> 04:42.040
Great.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.520
Girls are great!

04:47.600 --> 04:49.800
Mrs. Chen, I knew you would be my ally.

04:50.600 --> 04:51.920
I'm now very sure

04:52.000 --> 04:54.160
that I need him to be in my life.

04:54.240 --> 04:57.960
Although I haven't thought
of a perfect plan,

04:58.040 --> 04:58.960
I believe

04:59.040 --> 05:00.520
that I will.

05:03.960 --> 05:06.240
Mrs. Chen, I made a mistake.

05:10.520 --> 05:11.360
Please don't be mad.

05:11.440 --> 05:12.600
Wait. Why are you kneeling?

05:12.680 --> 05:13.640
Grandma is unreasonable.

05:14.680 --> 05:15.960
We will get engaged,

05:17.080 --> 05:17.920
as you wish.

05:19.400 --> 05:21.440
Zhuang Jie, you don't have to do this.

05:22.560 --> 05:23.800
A plain wedding band will do.

05:23.880 --> 05:25.480
No diamonds. They are not worth it.

05:52.760 --> 05:54.400
Your attention, please.

05:54.880 --> 05:57.280
This is the replay of felicitous news.

05:57.360 --> 05:59.960
Today, come to Liaogen Chicken

06:00.040 --> 06:02.320
and claim wedding candies.

06:03.400 --> 06:04.800
You put on something dapper!

06:05.280 --> 06:06.400
Handsome!

06:06.480 --> 06:08.440
Enough. Stop showing off.

06:08.520 --> 06:09.840
Everyone in this town

06:09.920 --> 06:11.000
knows you're engaged.

06:11.520 --> 06:12.600
Exactly.

06:12.680 --> 06:14.200
We have all seen engagements before.

06:14.280 --> 06:16.960
How come it's particularly festive

06:17.040 --> 06:18.040
when it's yours?

06:19.680 --> 06:21.520
Your grandma and Zhuang Jie's mom

06:21.600 --> 06:22.960
make rounds in the town every day.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.840
All they're missing is a loudspeaker.

06:24.920 --> 06:25.920
Can you believe it?

06:26.000 --> 06:27.200
What's wrong with that?

06:27.280 --> 06:30.040
We must make sure
all of Chen Maidong's admirers give up.

06:31.760 --> 06:34.120
He's the one who is lucky to snag you,

06:34.200 --> 06:35.240
not the other way around.

06:35.320 --> 06:36.440
What? It's just a joke.

06:36.520 --> 06:38.200
Mind your words.

06:38.280 --> 06:39.960
I am no longer single.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.760
I will not take this teasing from you.

06:41.840 --> 06:43.000
He's getting petty now.

06:43.640 --> 06:46.200
Anyway, did you invite everyone here
just for wedding candies?

06:46.280 --> 06:47.440
Where is the feast?

06:47.520 --> 06:48.400
-Right.
-Yes.

06:48.480 --> 06:50.760
Once we're done with our work,
we will hold something grand.

06:50.840 --> 06:51.880
When that happens,

06:51.960 --> 06:53.560
you're not leaving with an empty stomach.

06:53.640 --> 06:54.480
-Okay.
-Deal.

06:54.560 --> 06:55.520
-Okay.
-You sure can.

06:55.600 --> 06:56.840
I'm looking forward to it.

06:57.840 --> 06:59.960
-Wait. Where are you going?
-We have to go now.

07:00.040 --> 07:02.240
We have an engagement dinner to attend.

07:02.320 --> 07:03.200
All right, go.

07:03.280 --> 07:04.240
Go!

07:04.880 --> 07:06.280
-Go.
-Maidong.

07:06.360 --> 07:07.400
Have your parents come?

07:08.040 --> 07:10.280
-Yes.
-That's rare. Enjoy your time with them.

07:10.360 --> 07:11.440
Go now.

07:11.520 --> 07:12.680
-See you.
-Bye.

07:12.760 --> 07:13.920
-Bye.
-Bye.

07:14.480 --> 07:16.080
We'll treat you to a meal next time!

07:16.160 --> 07:17.040
-Sure!
-Okay!

07:17.120 --> 07:18.240
WEDDING

07:28.600 --> 07:31.400
Who decorated this? How fancy.

07:31.480 --> 07:32.600
Your siblings, I bet.

07:32.680 --> 07:34.440
My family would never
do something like this.

07:35.680 --> 07:38.520
It's considered exorbitant in this town.

07:38.600 --> 07:39.560
Do you think so?

07:40.040 --> 07:41.400
I find them out of place.

07:41.480 --> 07:42.400
You have no taste.

07:42.480 --> 07:43.320
Sorry.

07:43.840 --> 07:45.520
Pardon my ignorance.

07:51.480 --> 07:53.080
Congratulations on your engagement!

07:54.400 --> 07:55.800
Congratulations on your engagement!

08:00.160 --> 08:01.240
Jie!

08:02.040 --> 08:03.240
Jie.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.240
Grandma.

08:04.320 --> 08:06.400
I know we held this party in a rush,

08:06.480 --> 08:08.440
so it's not as grand as it could've been.

08:08.520 --> 08:09.920
I hope you don't mind.

08:10.000 --> 08:12.120
Mrs. Chen, don't say that.

08:12.600 --> 08:15.360
When they get married,
we can hold a grand party.

08:15.440 --> 08:16.720
Sure.

08:17.280 --> 08:19.120
Hello, sir, ma'am. I'm Zhuang Jie.

08:19.200 --> 08:20.360
Once we're married,

08:20.440 --> 08:21.520
I can call you Mother and Father.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.480
Is that okay?

08:22.560 --> 08:23.960
Sure.

08:24.040 --> 08:26.320
Thanks to you, everyone is reunited.

08:26.400 --> 08:27.600
Yes.

08:27.680 --> 08:28.920
Come. Let's eat and talk.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.800
-Sure.
-Let's eat and talk.

08:31.800 --> 08:33.080
We'll be in-laws.

08:36.640 --> 08:37.840
-Come.
-Take a seat.

08:37.919 --> 08:38.960
Take a seat.

08:39.960 --> 08:41.720
-Fill the glasses.
-Here.

09:10.600 --> 09:11.600
All right.

09:11.680 --> 09:12.600
Take a break.

09:12.680 --> 09:13.600
I'm not tired.

09:14.280 --> 09:16.520
I didn't know that your grandma left too.

09:17.560 --> 09:19.520
Your family went to send my parents off.

09:19.600 --> 09:21.680
My grandma will then send your family off.

09:21.760 --> 09:22.680
It's an endless cycle.

09:25.880 --> 09:27.800
You don't usually drink,

09:27.880 --> 09:29.520
but you drank a lot today.

09:29.600 --> 09:30.680
Are you feeling okay?

09:32.000 --> 09:32.920
I'm very happy.

09:33.000 --> 09:34.480
So I can take those drinks.

09:35.840 --> 09:38.240
Besides, I have drunk alcohol before.

09:39.800 --> 09:40.640
When?

09:41.320 --> 09:42.680
When we broke up.

09:42.760 --> 09:45.280
No way. We never broke up.

09:47.080 --> 09:47.960
That's right.

09:49.360 --> 09:50.640
We will never break up.

09:56.000 --> 09:57.240
Chen Maidong,

09:57.320 --> 09:59.920
does this all feel like a dream to you?

10:01.840 --> 10:04.080
I have never seen anyone
get engaged in such a rush.

10:07.280 --> 10:08.880
Will you regret it and not show up

10:08.960 --> 10:09.960
on the wedding day?

10:11.000 --> 10:12.400
Why would I do that?

10:12.480 --> 10:13.800
I finally get to call you mine.

10:13.880 --> 10:15.360
I'm worried that you might run away.

10:19.720 --> 10:20.880
Chen Maidong,

10:21.880 --> 10:23.000
thank you for loving me.

10:25.400 --> 10:28.360
You and this small town

10:28.440 --> 10:30.080
are like a bowl of heartwarming soup.

10:30.160 --> 10:33.680
Soothing and comforting.

10:36.720 --> 10:38.240
I know Shanghai is more beautiful.

10:39.480 --> 10:42.480
It's like an iridescent
and mesmerizing land.

10:45.600 --> 10:47.120
I take back what I said.

10:49.040 --> 10:50.320
I like Shanghai.

10:51.320 --> 10:52.520
But I like you more.

11:01.440 --> 11:02.400
Thank you too.

11:04.440 --> 11:07.000
My relationship with my parents
has never been so harmonious.

11:08.400 --> 11:09.920
It's as if we have become at peace

11:11.080 --> 11:12.520
with our past grievances.

11:15.160 --> 11:17.280
That's because you have a family now.

11:18.760 --> 11:20.280
You are now an adult.

11:29.800 --> 11:31.240
Hopefully, I won't be abandoned

11:32.360 --> 11:33.760
by my family again.

11:37.600 --> 11:38.560
Chen Maidong,

11:40.600 --> 11:42.640
I will always be your family.

11:46.240 --> 11:47.160
I believe you.

12:41.880 --> 12:42.960
Cucumber.

12:46.160 --> 12:47.760
Is this an afterparty?

12:47.840 --> 12:49.040
Didn't you drink enough earlier?

12:49.120 --> 12:51.720
We couldn't get drunk
in front of your future in-laws

12:51.800 --> 12:52.800
and embarrass you, right?

12:55.480 --> 12:56.960
What a hasty wedding.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.680
I was caught completely off-guard.

12:58.760 --> 13:01.400
I dropped everything in Shanghai
and rushed here.

13:01.480 --> 13:03.000
I can only hope nothing goes wrong.

13:03.080 --> 13:04.080
I appreciate that.

13:04.160 --> 13:06.080
I'll join you there very shortly.

13:07.720 --> 13:09.920
None of you
can mention Shanghai tonight, okay?

13:10.000 --> 13:11.640
You're right.

13:11.720 --> 13:13.240
Zhuang Jie, congratulations.

13:14.200 --> 13:15.200
-Cheers.
-Thank you.

13:22.600 --> 13:23.880
Don't chug it.

13:25.400 --> 13:28.160
I'm quite happy
that I decided to get engaged.

13:28.720 --> 13:30.800
The scarier it is,
the more decisive you have to be.

13:30.880 --> 13:33.480
Overthinking leads you nowhere.

13:33.560 --> 13:34.480
You have my support.

13:35.080 --> 13:36.000
But Zhuang Jie,

13:36.720 --> 13:38.400
marriage is grounded in real life.

13:38.480 --> 13:40.240
You need to be able to support yourself.

13:40.320 --> 13:41.920
Other than love, you also need money.

13:42.000 --> 13:42.880
I can earn money.

13:43.600 --> 13:46.040
Besides, it's not solely Maidong's duty.

13:46.120 --> 13:47.880
Anyway, who you choose to marry

13:47.960 --> 13:49.840
means choosing a certain lifestyle.

13:49.920 --> 13:51.000
I know that.

13:51.640 --> 13:54.160
All these impulsive decisions
were carefully planned.

14:03.000 --> 14:05.080
Mom, you're awfully quiet today.

14:05.840 --> 14:07.360
You were also quiet at the party.

14:07.440 --> 14:09.240
I was listening.

14:10.560 --> 14:12.520
I'm learning the new ways

14:12.600 --> 14:15.320
that young women treat marriage.

14:16.160 --> 14:17.720
What new ways?

14:18.440 --> 14:19.880
Finding someone you love

14:19.960 --> 14:21.200
and marrying him

14:21.280 --> 14:23.000
is like finding a needle in a haystack.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.160
Exactly.

14:24.880 --> 14:26.560
In the current dating scene,

14:26.640 --> 14:28.720
people think
that the more independent a woman is,

14:28.800 --> 14:29.840
the pickier she will be.

14:29.920 --> 14:31.400
Either she marries someone rich

14:31.480 --> 14:33.800
or someone more successful than her.

14:33.880 --> 14:35.120
But that's not true.

14:36.000 --> 14:38.280
In fact, the more mature women are,

14:38.360 --> 14:39.960
the more they crave emotional support.

14:40.040 --> 14:41.240
It has nothing to do

14:41.320 --> 14:42.520
with educational background,

14:42.600 --> 14:43.840
profession, or money.

14:43.920 --> 14:45.240
What matters

14:45.320 --> 14:46.520
is open-mindedness.

14:46.600 --> 14:49.640
It's no longer the era of housewives.

14:50.280 --> 14:51.320
What we want is

14:51.400 --> 14:52.640
a man with similar values

14:53.200 --> 14:54.800
who is emotionally available

14:54.880 --> 14:56.400
and comfortable to hang out with.

14:58.000 --> 14:58.840
That's right.

14:59.600 --> 15:03.680
Maintaining a cliché
but romantic thing like marriage

15:03.760 --> 15:05.760
requires mutual effort

15:05.840 --> 15:07.160
and full commitment

15:07.240 --> 15:08.840
to fighting against the injustice,

15:08.920 --> 15:10.680
unfairness, and restraints

15:10.760 --> 15:13.440
of social norms so deeply ingrained in us.

15:13.920 --> 15:15.240
Many people won't understand

15:15.320 --> 15:16.920
what you said,

15:17.000 --> 15:18.200
including a lot of women.

15:18.280 --> 15:19.200
Precisely.

15:20.440 --> 15:21.760
Godmother,

15:21.840 --> 15:23.800
the poverty relief
that this town desperately needs

15:23.880 --> 15:25.160
is the dispelling of ignorance.

15:27.120 --> 15:28.400
I don't understand everything,

15:28.480 --> 15:29.680
but I do think

15:29.760 --> 15:31.360
both of you are right.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.920
You remind me of the time

15:35.000 --> 15:36.480
I got married and gave birth.

15:37.920 --> 15:39.120
For us, getting married

15:39.200 --> 15:42.120
is like heading to a tourist site.

15:42.680 --> 15:43.840
Everyone takes the bus,

15:43.920 --> 15:45.120
heads in the same direction,

15:45.200 --> 15:46.200
disembarks,

15:46.280 --> 15:47.600
and takes photos.

15:47.680 --> 15:49.960
Everyone is doing the same,

15:50.040 --> 15:52.680
and no one wants to feel left out.

15:53.400 --> 15:55.440
And so, we get married.

15:56.880 --> 15:58.840
Some marriages

15:58.920 --> 16:00.160
end up happy.

16:01.320 --> 16:03.040
Some end with a tragedy.

16:05.240 --> 16:06.320
I'm serious.

16:06.400 --> 16:09.080
We should play our conversation tonight

16:09.160 --> 16:10.720
on a loop on the public speakers.

16:10.800 --> 16:11.880
I know, right?

16:12.400 --> 16:14.920
At the same time, I'm also quite upset.

16:15.000 --> 16:18.080
I toiled and raised three children.

16:19.960 --> 16:21.600
And now, I'm losing one.

16:22.200 --> 16:24.760
It doesn't sit right with me.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.480
The Chens got lucky.

16:26.560 --> 16:28.440
Godmother, I must correct you there.

16:29.160 --> 16:30.320
Didn't the Chens

16:30.400 --> 16:32.440
give you a son in return?

16:32.520 --> 16:33.360
That's right.

16:33.440 --> 16:35.440
Your daughter
is getting married, not sold.

16:35.520 --> 16:36.600
I'm not changing my surname.

16:37.480 --> 16:38.600
Right.

16:38.680 --> 16:39.920
Think positively.

16:40.000 --> 16:41.760
Chen Maidong
is better than all three of you.

16:41.840 --> 16:42.960
I'm so happy.

16:43.040 --> 16:44.160
-Come.
-Come.

16:46.280 --> 16:47.480
To Godmother.

16:47.560 --> 16:48.720
To Mr. He.

16:49.480 --> 16:50.520
And to your dad.

17:01.280 --> 17:02.280
Are you plastered?

17:03.480 --> 17:04.720
Modern women.

17:10.440 --> 17:11.359
Don't eat so much.

17:11.440 --> 17:12.440
Look at your belly.

17:12.520 --> 17:14.079
It's none of your business.

17:15.079 --> 17:16.040
Where are the others?

17:16.119 --> 17:18.880
They went home. Their wives called.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.560
Then you two should leave too.

17:20.640 --> 17:22.119
You are disturbing my grandma's sleep.

17:22.200 --> 17:23.760
Don't kick us out. Let us stay.

17:23.839 --> 17:25.480
My mom let me stay out late tonight.

17:26.040 --> 17:27.640
I don't want to go home either.

17:27.720 --> 17:28.760
My wife is pregnant.

17:28.840 --> 17:30.400
She has wild mood swings.

17:30.480 --> 17:31.960
Her hormones are all over the place.

17:32.040 --> 17:34.160
Stop. You're scaring the future groom.

17:34.720 --> 17:36.560
In the past, you were the one scaring him.

17:37.960 --> 17:39.160
-Hedgehog.
-Thanks.

17:40.120 --> 17:41.880
Grandma told me

17:41.960 --> 17:43.400
that you found a decent job.

17:43.480 --> 17:44.520
What does it entail?

17:44.600 --> 17:45.760
Count me in.

17:45.840 --> 17:48.160
I'm telling you, if I get the deal,

17:48.240 --> 17:49.440
half of the town will know.

17:51.080 --> 17:52.480
-What a bluff.
-Why would I bluff?

17:53.160 --> 17:54.040
Hear me out.

17:55.120 --> 17:57.560
I traveled to Hainan a while ago.

17:57.640 --> 17:59.120
I was driving a big wig around.

17:59.600 --> 18:01.440
Dr. Fang from the provincial hospital

18:01.520 --> 18:02.360
introduced him to me.

18:02.440 --> 18:03.440
The man is very kind

18:03.520 --> 18:05.080
and doesn't mind my past records.

18:05.160 --> 18:07.240
He works in tourism,

18:07.320 --> 18:08.680
and he went to Hainan

18:08.760 --> 18:11.040
to check out
the medical tourism pilot zone.

18:11.120 --> 18:13.200
I learned a lot from him.

18:13.280 --> 18:15.320
-Medical tourism?
-Medical tourism.

18:15.400 --> 18:16.720
What is that? I don't understand.

18:17.560 --> 18:19.600
Tourism is huge in Hainan.

18:19.680 --> 18:21.200
It's leagues above Nanping's.

18:21.280 --> 18:22.960
The medical tourism pilot zone

18:23.040 --> 18:24.880
has comprehensive medical resources,

18:24.960 --> 18:26.880
boosting the health service industry
and others.

18:26.960 --> 18:28.800
Yes, and I heard that in Thailand,

18:28.880 --> 18:30.480
Singapore, and Indonesia,

18:30.560 --> 18:32.040
the medical tourism industry

18:32.120 --> 18:34.320
can produce up to billions of yuan.

18:34.880 --> 18:36.760
And this pilot zone has something

18:36.840 --> 18:37.960
called Green Path,

18:38.040 --> 18:38.880
expediting approval.

18:38.960 --> 18:41.000
New drugs and medical devices

18:41.080 --> 18:42.720
can be put into clinical trials quickly.

18:43.760 --> 18:44.800
Well done, Hedgehog.

18:44.880 --> 18:45.880
You know your thing.

18:45.960 --> 18:47.640
I listened carefully when I was with him.

18:47.720 --> 18:48.720
So serious.

18:48.800 --> 18:50.000
Hedgehog,

18:50.080 --> 18:52.320
can you introduce this guy to me?

18:52.400 --> 18:53.640
Sure.

18:53.720 --> 18:55.120
Wait. Are you interested in this?

18:55.200 --> 18:56.160
Are you dumb?

18:56.720 --> 18:58.200
What does Zhuang Jie do?

18:59.160 --> 19:00.280
I get it now.

19:00.360 --> 19:02.560
You are planning

19:02.640 --> 19:03.840
for your future.

19:05.040 --> 19:08.200
Maidong is more about action than words.

19:09.080 --> 19:10.400
Use tea in place of wine.

19:10.480 --> 19:12.880
-Congratulations on your engagement.
-Congratulations. Cheers.

19:27.840 --> 19:29.920
Jie, you just got engaged.

19:30.000 --> 19:31.320
Why are you sighing?

19:32.400 --> 19:33.840
Are you so happy that you can't sleep

19:34.680 --> 19:35.760
so you came out to meditate?

19:37.600 --> 19:38.480
Yan,

19:40.160 --> 19:42.320
I can't lose Chen Maidong.

19:43.160 --> 19:44.360
Are you sick, Zhuang Jie?

19:45.400 --> 19:46.560
Or are you drunk?

19:48.840 --> 19:50.680
I'm sober.

19:51.360 --> 19:52.840
That's why I'm even more upset.

19:53.440 --> 19:54.960
What are you going on about?

19:55.560 --> 19:57.160
Everything was so perfect today.

19:57.240 --> 19:58.520
Yes, today.

19:59.520 --> 20:00.640
In a few days,

20:00.720 --> 20:02.040
I have to return to Shanghai.

20:03.400 --> 20:05.120
Chen Maidong will be sad.

20:06.520 --> 20:08.200
Then talk to him.

20:08.280 --> 20:09.680
He is not unreasonable.

20:10.240 --> 20:11.880
What's the point of reasoning with him?

20:12.840 --> 20:14.240
I can't give him a definitive answer

20:14.760 --> 20:16.080
because I don't know

20:16.160 --> 20:17.680
if my startup will succeed.

20:19.400 --> 20:21.040
I used to think

20:21.600 --> 20:23.240
that I could shrug everything off.

20:23.960 --> 20:25.120
And "lovers."

20:25.760 --> 20:27.200
I was such an idiot.

20:30.960 --> 20:31.880
Jie,

20:34.040 --> 20:35.280
where is your courage?

20:35.960 --> 20:39.320
I have never seen you defeated
by anything.

20:40.080 --> 20:42.280
That's because I have never cared so much

20:42.360 --> 20:44.040
about anything before.

20:47.320 --> 20:49.000
You say you're afraid of losing Maidong.

20:49.920 --> 20:51.040
So am I.

20:53.040 --> 20:55.720
When I imagine him
becoming someone else's brother-in-law,

20:56.720 --> 20:58.120
it feels like a knife to my heart.

21:08.400 --> 21:09.840
Are we all clear now?

21:09.920 --> 21:12.440
The agenda will proceed
as Zhuang Jie told us just now.

21:12.520 --> 21:13.600
Don't panic.

21:13.680 --> 21:16.680
I knew those kids wouldn't last
for a day while we were away.

21:16.760 --> 21:19.200
The investors are supposed
to visit next month.

21:19.280 --> 21:21.320
Why are they suddenly coming tomorrow?

21:23.800 --> 21:25.240
Are you not returning with me today?

21:28.400 --> 21:29.400
I can't.

21:29.960 --> 21:32.560
I need to explain everything
to Chen Maidong before I leave.

21:32.640 --> 21:33.960
That's true.

21:34.040 --> 21:35.600
You're no different from a scammer

21:35.680 --> 21:37.640
if you run away
one day after getting engaged.

21:37.720 --> 21:38.920
It's my fault.

21:39.000 --> 21:40.360
For some reason,

21:40.440 --> 21:42.160
whenever I want to bring it up,

21:42.240 --> 21:44.240
no words come out of my mouth.

21:44.760 --> 21:46.240
I know why.

21:46.840 --> 21:47.880
You care about him.

21:49.680 --> 21:51.640
All right, I have to go now.

21:52.520 --> 21:53.680
Listen.

21:53.760 --> 21:55.200
You have to be there

21:55.280 --> 21:56.360
by 2:30 p.m. tomorrow.

21:56.440 --> 21:57.920
We invested all our starting capital.

21:58.000 --> 21:59.160
Ms. Huang also did her best.

21:59.240 --> 22:02.440
She called and introduced everyone to us.

22:02.520 --> 22:03.360
Everything is ready.

22:03.440 --> 22:04.600
We just need you to be there.

22:04.680 --> 22:06.960
If you don't show up,
you'll never hear the end of it.

22:07.040 --> 22:08.240
Okay.

22:08.320 --> 22:09.160
Go now.

22:09.240 --> 22:10.160
See you.

22:10.680 --> 22:11.560
Wang Xixia.

22:13.840 --> 22:15.120
I don't know why,

22:15.840 --> 22:17.040
but I'm panicking a bit.

22:18.160 --> 22:20.920
It's not like you to be this fainthearted.

22:22.080 --> 22:24.240
Tell Chen Maidong everything now.

22:24.320 --> 22:25.560
Don't beat around the bush.

22:26.400 --> 22:27.920
Not only are you heading to Shanghai,

22:28.000 --> 22:30.120
you'll stay there for a while.

22:30.200 --> 22:32.080
Don't let the whole team down.

22:32.160 --> 22:33.240
Understood?

22:33.320 --> 22:34.640
Don't worry. I know what to do.

22:35.760 --> 22:36.600
See you.

23:07.120 --> 23:08.440
What are you doing here?

23:08.520 --> 23:09.520
I just arrived.

23:09.600 --> 23:10.640
Are you heading out?

23:10.720 --> 23:12.360
There's an emergency. I have to go.

23:12.440 --> 23:13.920
Go ahead. I'm fine.

23:14.640 --> 23:15.480
Perhaps--

23:15.560 --> 23:16.880
Forget about me. Just go.

23:16.960 --> 23:18.320
Go!

23:18.400 --> 23:20.000
See you. I'll call you later.

23:20.080 --> 23:21.000
Sure.

23:30.040 --> 23:30.960
See you.

23:32.160 --> 23:33.080
Bye.

23:50.000 --> 23:50.960
Jie,

23:51.040 --> 23:52.120
are you really leaving?

23:57.280 --> 23:58.920
Stop clinging to your sister.

23:59.000 --> 24:00.800
You'll make her emotional.

24:01.880 --> 24:03.440
She's upset not because of me.

24:05.040 --> 24:07.240
What? Haven't you told Maidong?

24:08.760 --> 24:10.240
He must be busy.

24:10.320 --> 24:12.080
He hasn't replied to my message.

24:12.160 --> 24:13.000
You…

24:13.080 --> 24:15.680
You must've purposely waited
until the last minute to tell him.

24:15.760 --> 24:17.000
That's right.

24:17.640 --> 24:18.560
Jie,

24:18.640 --> 24:20.520
I have an idea for you.

24:20.600 --> 24:22.400
Tell him it's not
a long-distance relationship

24:22.480 --> 24:23.800
but a business trip.

24:23.880 --> 24:25.440
What kind of lame idea is that?

24:25.520 --> 24:27.120
Yes, don't listen to her.

24:27.200 --> 24:28.400
Don't pull any tricks.

24:28.480 --> 24:29.720
You have to be honest with him.

24:29.800 --> 24:30.960
Do you hear me?

24:49.000 --> 24:49.880
Hello?

24:50.800 --> 24:51.680
I just knocked off.

24:51.760 --> 24:52.760
I was about to call you.

24:53.520 --> 24:54.400
Where are you?

24:55.800 --> 24:57.640
Sure, I'll come find you.

25:09.040 --> 25:11.120
NANPING NORTH STATION

25:18.480 --> 25:20.880
Who are we picking up? Which platform?

25:28.520 --> 25:29.600
Zhuang Jie!

25:36.640 --> 25:38.120
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

25:38.200 --> 25:39.120
Who are we picking up?

25:45.760 --> 25:46.720
Answer me first.

25:50.400 --> 25:51.560
We're not picking anyone up.

25:54.520 --> 25:55.480
I'm leaving.

25:58.760 --> 25:59.960
For how long?

26:01.520 --> 26:02.800
I don't know yet.

26:02.880 --> 26:03.880
How long?

26:04.640 --> 26:06.240
I'm starting my business,

26:07.120 --> 26:09.720
so I'll be pretty busy
for the first two years.

26:13.320 --> 26:14.200
Chen Maidong,

26:15.240 --> 26:17.400
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

26:17.480 --> 26:20.080
I just couldn't find
the right opportunity to tell you.

26:21.120 --> 26:22.480
I will be responsible for you.

26:22.560 --> 26:23.440
What responsibility

26:25.320 --> 26:26.720
do you think I need from you?

26:27.200 --> 26:30.000
You told me that you didn't want to wait.
I understand that.

26:30.080 --> 26:33.360
And I don't want to be
your confidant or lover.

26:33.440 --> 26:34.520
That's why we got engaged.

26:34.600 --> 26:36.280
So you remember that we are engaged.

26:37.400 --> 26:39.120
Of course. What are you saying?

26:39.880 --> 26:40.960
So

26:41.960 --> 26:44.160
is impulsiveness your view of marriage?

26:46.080 --> 26:47.040
Chen Maidong,

26:48.000 --> 26:49.960
life isn't planned out day by day.

26:50.040 --> 26:51.760
Do you want me to make a presentation

26:51.840 --> 26:53.240
on my future for you?

26:53.320 --> 26:54.160
Sure.

26:54.880 --> 26:56.080
Tell me.

26:56.160 --> 26:58.400
How do you plan to spend each coming day?

27:02.120 --> 27:03.800
Your attention, please.

27:03.880 --> 27:08.520
Train G5185 to Shanghai

27:08.600 --> 27:10.160
is arriving soon.

27:10.840 --> 27:14.360
Please gather your personal items

27:14.440 --> 27:15.720
and board on time.

27:15.800 --> 27:16.640
Go then.

27:17.400 --> 27:18.440
Don't miss your train.

27:19.960 --> 27:20.960
I won't see you off.

27:22.200 --> 27:23.160
Chen Maidong,

27:23.240 --> 27:24.480
I'm not leaving you.

27:27.560 --> 27:29.000
Think of it as a business trip.

27:29.880 --> 27:31.600
Can you do that, please?

27:33.560 --> 27:34.480
Zhuang Jie,

27:35.640 --> 27:37.880
I'll respect your decision
even if you want to leave me.

27:38.960 --> 27:41.600
I have never gotten
in the way of your dreams.

27:43.520 --> 27:45.040
But you can't treat marriage as a joke.

27:45.120 --> 27:47.080
Nor should you act first
and tell me later. Get it?

27:49.040 --> 27:50.440
You're mistaken.

27:51.440 --> 27:54.000
I might not be as thoughtful as you
in handling matters,

27:54.080 --> 27:55.720
but you truly misunderstood me here.

27:58.360 --> 27:59.400
Go.

28:01.520 --> 28:02.840
Think about it in Shanghai.

28:02.920 --> 28:04.400
I already know what I want.

28:05.440 --> 28:06.640
Give me back the wedding ring.

28:06.720 --> 28:08.160
Forget about this engagement.

28:10.960 --> 28:12.040
No.

28:12.120 --> 28:14.240
Why? It's engraved with my name.

28:14.320 --> 28:15.160
Give it back.

28:18.280 --> 28:19.200
No!

28:25.320 --> 28:26.720
I…

28:27.280 --> 28:28.440
I'm sorry.

28:29.280 --> 28:30.400
I didn't mean to do that.

28:31.000 --> 28:32.040
I…

28:35.960 --> 28:38.120
You get a nosebleed so easily.

28:38.200 --> 28:39.160
Let me wipe it.

28:50.560 --> 28:51.480
Chen Maidong.

28:53.440 --> 28:54.560
Chen Maidong!

28:56.040 --> 28:57.040
Chen Maidong!

28:59.720 --> 29:00.680
Chen Maidong!

29:02.720 --> 29:05.000
Chen Maidong,
I will not break up with you!

29:42.600 --> 29:44.560
Your attention, please.

29:44.640 --> 29:48.440
Train G5185 to Shanghai is arriving soon.

29:48.520 --> 29:50.480
-Hello?
-is arriving soon.

29:51.400 --> 29:53.360
-Please gather your personal items…
-I'll be there this afternoon.

29:53.440 --> 29:55.960
-…and board on time.
-Yes, Wang Xixia.

29:56.040 --> 29:57.120
Stop rushing me.

29:57.760 --> 29:59.680
Your attention, please.

29:59.760 --> 30:04.280
Train G5185 to Shanghai

30:04.360 --> 30:05.760
is arriving soon.

30:06.520 --> 30:09.920
Please gather your personal items

30:10.000 --> 30:11.880
and board on time.

31:11.000 --> 31:12.720
Zhuang Jie, this afternoon,

31:12.800 --> 31:15.000
representatives of our biggest investors
will be present.

31:15.080 --> 31:17.600
I've sent all the relevant documents
to your inbox.

31:20.080 --> 31:21.280
You know very well

31:21.360 --> 31:23.760
we only have one chance to pitch our idea.

31:24.440 --> 31:26.480
We're all counting on you.

31:27.080 --> 31:27.920
Good luck.

32:47.160 --> 32:48.560
Hopefully, I won't be abandoned

32:49.600 --> 32:50.960
by my family again.

32:54.800 --> 32:55.800
Chen Maidong,

32:57.440 --> 32:59.920
I will always be your family.

33:38.480 --> 33:39.640
Seeing your mood,

33:39.720 --> 33:41.640
I don't even know
if I should celebrate with you.

33:43.480 --> 33:44.560
Congratulations to us.

33:54.840 --> 33:57.680
Do you know how amazing
your proposal this afternoon was?

33:58.600 --> 34:00.120
It was brilliant.

34:00.720 --> 34:02.040
Even I was charmed by you.

34:04.080 --> 34:05.320
So Zhuang Jie,

34:05.400 --> 34:06.880
coming back was the right decision.

34:06.960 --> 34:08.480
You belong to this stage.

34:08.560 --> 34:10.000
Don't give it up.

34:10.639 --> 34:11.639
I know.

34:12.920 --> 34:14.280
I never planned to give it up.

34:16.239 --> 34:18.520
Then cheer up.

34:18.600 --> 34:21.080
Chen Maidong
didn't have time to prepare himself.

34:21.760 --> 34:23.400
After some time, he'll come around.

34:28.159 --> 34:30.760
I'm the one who needs
to figure everything out.

34:33.000 --> 34:34.159
On my way back,

34:35.679 --> 34:37.400
I kept asking myself why.

34:41.199 --> 34:42.120
Why

34:43.960 --> 34:46.120
am I so obsessed with a TV tower?

34:55.960 --> 34:57.320
It's not the tower's fault.

34:58.800 --> 35:02.000
We are all confined
by a cage of our own making.

35:39.840 --> 35:40.720
Chen Maidong,

35:44.000 --> 35:45.560
will you hate me

35:46.480 --> 35:47.520
after I leave Nanping?

35:57.280 --> 35:58.720
Life is unpredictable.

35:59.320 --> 36:00.560
Nothing is predictable.

36:02.280 --> 36:03.960
We shouldn't
sacrifice ourselves for anyone.

36:05.200 --> 36:06.600
Let's spend our days to the fullest

36:08.400 --> 36:09.800
while we're still together.

36:13.360 --> 36:15.880
My career isn't as noble as yours.

36:17.040 --> 36:18.560
Shanghai isn't my home either.

36:19.600 --> 36:22.440
But they're quite important to me.

36:24.120 --> 36:25.520
I wish to be successful

36:26.480 --> 36:27.880
and be respected by other people.

36:28.560 --> 36:30.560
I wish to prove my worth.

36:32.680 --> 36:34.600
That's why I don't want
to make any compromises.

36:35.120 --> 36:36.040
I don't want

36:36.920 --> 36:39.680
to hate myself or you

36:40.480 --> 36:42.960
five years or ten years
after getting married to you.

36:44.400 --> 36:47.280
I don't want to imagine
the kind of life that I could have had.

36:52.120 --> 36:53.240
I support your choice.

37:41.680 --> 37:42.640
Grandma,

37:42.720 --> 37:44.560
this will be my last chicken soup.

37:45.200 --> 37:46.520
No more chicken,

37:47.560 --> 37:49.960
in any form, for the next six months.

37:50.040 --> 37:50.880
Sure.

37:51.480 --> 37:52.560
As you wish.

37:54.680 --> 37:55.520
Maidong--

37:55.600 --> 37:56.440
Grandma.

37:57.600 --> 37:58.680
Don't say anything.

38:01.440 --> 38:02.280
Okay.

38:03.280 --> 38:04.800
It's your own business.

38:04.880 --> 38:06.360
You handle it.

38:08.560 --> 38:10.040
But you bear the main responsibility

38:11.800 --> 38:13.000
for the coerced engagement.

38:13.080 --> 38:16.680
But Jie agreed to it too.

38:16.760 --> 38:20.240
We reached a consensus,
so I did what I did.

38:20.320 --> 38:22.920
But an engagement
doesn't solve our current problems.

38:23.000 --> 38:24.720
You can keep this promise in mind

38:24.800 --> 38:26.200
and think about the rest much later.

38:29.160 --> 38:31.840
Zhuang Jie and I
have different visions for the future.

38:33.400 --> 38:35.400
I'm fine with monotony,
but she may not be.

38:37.400 --> 38:40.200
What if she encounters a better man
or a bigger temptation in the future?

38:40.840 --> 38:41.880
What should she do?

38:43.600 --> 38:45.880
You underestimate her.

38:45.960 --> 38:47.920
I trust her as much as you do.

38:48.000 --> 38:49.400
But what exactly does she want?

38:50.000 --> 38:51.960
Only time and distance will tell.

38:53.200 --> 38:54.400
Maidong.

38:57.520 --> 38:58.480
What about you?

38:59.160 --> 39:01.080
What do you want for yourself?

39:04.600 --> 39:05.840
You asked me the same question

39:07.480 --> 39:09.600
when Dad and Mom got divorced.

39:12.280 --> 39:13.520
I told you back then

39:14.920 --> 39:16.000
that I hated Mom.

39:17.560 --> 39:19.600
So I decided to live with you and Grandpa.

39:22.480 --> 39:24.000
But that wasn't the truth.

39:26.960 --> 39:28.240
I do not hate her.

39:30.400 --> 39:31.640
I let her go

39:33.480 --> 39:36.400
because I know a single mom with a son
cannot remarry easily.

39:40.080 --> 39:41.280
But little did I know,

39:43.040 --> 39:44.080
letting go

39:47.080 --> 39:48.680
would result in over a decade of pain.

39:50.200 --> 39:51.120
Maidong,

39:52.560 --> 39:54.880
sometimes it's okay to be selfish.

39:54.960 --> 39:56.040
I know.

39:59.400 --> 40:01.640
So I won't make the same mistake
with Zhuang Jie.

40:03.800 --> 40:05.640
I have my own methods and procedures.

40:07.160 --> 40:08.520
Don't meddle in this anymore.

40:15.080 --> 40:17.680
CARE FOR LIFE, RESPECT NATURE

40:58.040 --> 41:03.000
SIX MONTHS LATER

41:04.320 --> 41:08.080
NANPU BRIDGE

41:09.160 --> 41:10.000
Miss,

41:10.640 --> 41:12.240
you must be a local.

41:13.200 --> 41:14.360
I knew it.

41:15.680 --> 41:17.080
Did you notice my accent?

41:18.640 --> 41:19.640
You didn't, right?

41:21.360 --> 41:22.600
I'm from the northeast.

41:22.680 --> 41:25.040
I left home when I was young.

41:25.120 --> 41:27.080
I've been to many places.

41:28.120 --> 41:29.400
But I love Shanghai the most.

41:29.480 --> 41:31.280
It's as good as the Western countries.

41:31.360 --> 41:34.080
When I'm not driving, I'm traveling.

41:34.160 --> 41:36.360
Yu Garden, Lujiazui,
and City God Temple of Shanghai.

41:36.440 --> 41:38.040
I can never have enough of them.

41:38.120 --> 41:39.280
But you know,

41:39.840 --> 41:42.440
as time goes by, I miss home.

41:44.640 --> 41:47.320
We always think we have a free soul.

41:48.240 --> 41:51.040
We think we can go

41:51.120 --> 41:52.400
wherever life takes us.

41:54.920 --> 41:57.880
But when something serious happens,

41:57.960 --> 41:59.280
you'll realize

42:00.040 --> 42:01.280
that you have nothing.

42:01.360 --> 42:03.720
We all crave companionship.

42:03.800 --> 42:05.880
Life is too short

42:05.960 --> 42:07.280
to fuss over the details.

42:07.360 --> 42:08.640
Mister!

42:08.720 --> 42:12.560
SHANGHAI WENHUA FUNERAL PARLOR

42:12.640 --> 42:14.040
Before you graduate,

42:14.120 --> 42:16.040
you'll have more field trips
and workshops.

42:16.560 --> 42:18.040
In the end,

42:18.520 --> 42:20.680
if you decide to stay in funeral services,

42:21.400 --> 42:22.760
I hope you remember

42:23.480 --> 42:24.640
that the more honest we are,

42:24.720 --> 42:26.320
the more reassured our clients will be.

42:26.840 --> 42:29.520
The stigma on us will disappear one day.

42:30.280 --> 42:32.600
We won't fear death as much as we do.

42:33.240 --> 42:34.600
After all, in our lives,

42:35.280 --> 42:37.840
death isn't unknown or uncommon.

42:52.840 --> 42:53.680
Wait.

45:33.080 --> 45:39.680
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
